{"3879700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rebolt", "steam_appid": 3879700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>4-Player Online Co-op</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879700/extras/7f9bc9eacc15b53ef59e0bb7b7ad8d8a.avif?t=1762864862\" width=1560 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you feel gunning solo, or want to topple fascist regimes with friends, Rebolt has what you're looking for. Jump in, gun down bots, and cover each others backs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879700/extras/891abce47d372feb97432d97c8e18843.avif?t=1762864862\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879700/extras_big/891abce47d372feb97432d97c8e18843.webp?t=1762864862 width=1560 height=871 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Steampunk Arsenal</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879700/extras/0b81ad9379e5ccfa32eafb5721b89b6f.avif?t=1762864862\" width=1560 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Pistols to Rifles, Airships, and Grenades, our rebels have it all. Carefully boost your loadout and abilities throughout the run, forging upgrades from robot scrap!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879700/extras/2d670d03d75a2a042e54e7e905b0b67d.avif?t=1762864862\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879700/extras_big/2d670d03d75a2a042e54e7e905b0b67d.webp?t=1762864862 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Air Gunners</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879700/extras/742180db34956479ae49161c30c86e9b.avif?t=1762864862\" width=1560 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling threatened on the battlefield? No worries. Take control of your rebellion's airship turrets to assist yourself in healing or clearing hordes of enemies when the city gets too chaotic and overrun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879700/extras/81fd06e9e29b704c9a7b85b7febd91ed.avif?t=1762864862\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879700/extras_big/81fd06e9e29b704c9a7b85b7febd91ed.webp?t=1762864862 width=1560 height=872 /></span></p></p><br><h1>WISHLIST NOW</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879700/extras/61435d20a27b41a278217f97ff5314e8.avif?t=1762864862\" width=1560 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlisting helps rebels like you get notified the moment Rebolt hits Early Access. It’s the fastest way to join the uprising (and give us devs a morale boost while we hammer some more copper and brass together for you)</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of rebels and fight back against oppressive corporations. Engage in tactical combat both on the ground and from the skies, switching between fast-paced third-person firefights and commanding an airship to support allies. Salvage defeated enemies and craft powerful upgrades to shape your own build and become stronger as the battle intensifies. Whether playing solo or cooperatively with friends, teamwork, strategy, and progression are key to overthrowing the corporate regime and surviving escalating threats.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of rebels and fight back against oppressive corporations. Engage in tactical combat both on the ground and from the skies, switching between fast-paced third-person firefights and commanding an airship to support allies. Salvage defeated enemies and craft powerful upgrades to shape your own build and become stronger as the battle intensifies. Whether playing solo or cooperatively with friends, teamwork, strategy, and progression are key to overthrowing the corporate regime and surviving escalating threats.</p>", "short_description": "Take the role of rebels and fight back against oppressive corporations. Engage in tactical combat both on the ground and from the skies, switching between fast-paced third-person firefights and commanding an airship to support allies.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879700/d4799db8771a212f58bb7674cbca5f7882c47e8c/header.jpg?t=1762864862", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879700/dcfe6cac49c811b15fa99870fe32ea2f8226cd8f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762864862", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879700/dcfe6cac49c811b15fa99870fe32ea2f8226cd8f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762864862", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel i7 7800k or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 6GB or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_u